    // ─── VERCEL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    // VERCEL (official) — projects, deployments, logs, domains, toolbar comments
    // Remote MCP con OAuth — richiede login Vercel al primo avvio
    // Docs: https://vercel.com/docs/agent-resources/vercel-mcp
